# Model card for magnoliasis (medium)

* Language: fa_IR (Persian, Iran)
* Speakers: 1
* Quality: medium
* Samplerate: 22,050Hz

## Dataset

* URL: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/magnoliasis/persian-tts-dataset
* License: **None.** The dataset has no license: its Kaggle page lists the license as "Unknown", and it does not say who the speaker is or where the recordings came from.

No one has granted any rights to use this voice. Do not assume it may be used, modified or redistributed for any purpose, commercial or otherwise. It is not on the [commercial use](https://github.com/OHF-Voice/piper1-gpl/blob/main/docs/COMMERCIAL_USE.md) list.

The voice is named after the Kaggle account that published the dataset. It is a different speaker from `fa_IR-amir`.

## Training

Finetuned from the U.S. English hifi_tts_92 base model (medium quality; the voice of Cori Samuel, Hi-Fi TTS reader 92), with MRD and SDP.

Default inference settings are noise_scale 0.5 and noise_w 0.333.

Requires Piper 1.5 or higher.
